{"answer_text":"If nobody on the team wants to be the CRM admin, prioritise sensible defaults, guided import and few required fields. The easiest to get running: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Essentials**: Powerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier. [2]\n- **Tallyfox Starter**: Built for teams under 20, with email sequences on every plan and a setup most people finish in an afternoon. [3]\n- **Pipewell**: Pipeline-first and very visual; a good pick if your process is mostly deal stages. [4]\n\nIn short, trial Northwind CRM and Tallyfox side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50aa-70af-8b25-406f77220f51","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:17.850Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["simple crm onboarding time","easiest crm to set up"],"latency_ms":4430,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[155,168],[532,545]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[279,287],[550,558]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[416,424]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"rela